Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/tuple_single_field.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     val p = (x: 1);
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0003]: a tuple needs at least two named members
  --> tests/ui/tuple_single_field.jet:2:13
    |
  2 |     val p = (x: 1);
    |             ^^^^^^
 Why: a single `(name: value)` would be ambiguous with grouping — use a one-field `struct` instead
 Fix: add another member: `(x: 1, y: 2)`
